eatures:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Adorable Miners:</strong> Meet a lovable cast of characters known as Rocklings, each with unique look and irresistible charm. Watch them come to life as they embark on their mining adventure!<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic Exploration:</strong> Experience an ever-changing adventure with randomly generated maps, ensuring a fresh and exciting gameplay experience every time you play. Traverse through the landscape with conventional pick-axe or power up with explosives!<br></li><li><strong>Curated Campaign:</strong> Immerse yourself in a handcrafted campaign with carefully designed levels that progressively introduce new gameplay mechanics and present exciting challenges for players to conquer.<br></li><li><strong>Level Editor:</strong> Unleash your creativity with the built-in level editor! Craft your own scenarios, puzzles, and challenges, and share them with the Rocklings community. Let your imagination run wild as you design the ultimate mining adventure.<br></li><li><strong>Base-Building:</strong> Guide your Rocklings to strategically mine rocks, revealing valuable resources with which to build and expand your base of operations! Build a power station to electrify your base! Build a scanner to reveal the location of resources! Build a shower so your Rocklings can clean up after a day of hard work! And many more!<br></li><li><strong>Mining Arsenal:</strong> Enjoy the latest and greatest mining technology! Spend your hard-earned resources to call in a drilling vehicle, bulldozer or truck and take your mining operation to the next level!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627370/extras/5ba46cae6546a38f7c30d98992e86f69.poster.avif?t=1752388095\" width=576 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627370/extras/5ba46cae6546a38f7c30d98992e86f6